comments.body:
> Problem is that Tidepool doesn't allow to upload everything (profile is big problem), and until they extend their APIs there is nothing for us to do. Tidepool is currently working on their Loop solution, so they don't have time to do anything else.

> Tidepool plugin already exists but it's off because we cannot upload data correctly

@andyrozman @MilosKozak apologies for the naive question but I could use a pointer. Could you elaborate on what is it that is missing? I was casually looking into this, and came across https://tidepool.atlassian.net/browse/BACK-2019 and https://tidepool.atlassian.net/browse/BACK-2020 which seem to suggest that Tidepool's platform has gained some support for looping profile fields (geared towards Tidepool Loop but potentialy generic enough?). At minimum, this is a self-contained change that can help guide the addition of additional fields that AAPS may require. I would love to hear from from you and some guidance on how to proceed. Thank you!
